     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: CodeSystem BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial</b></p><a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial\"> </a><a name=\"hcBRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Língua: en</p></div><p>Este case-sensitive sistema de código <code>http://www.saude.gov.br/fhir/r4/CodeSystem/BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial</code> define o seguinte códigos:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td><td><b>Portuguese (Brazil) (pt)</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">pending<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-pending\"> </a></td><td>Pending</td><td>Pendente</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">booked<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-booked\"> </a></td><td>Booked</td><td>Agendado</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">attended<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-attended\"> </a></td><td>Attended/Hospitalized</td><td>Atendido/Internado</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cancelled<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-cancelled\"> </a></td><td>Cancelled</td><td>Negado/Cancelado</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">absence<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-absence\"> </a></td><td>Absence</td><td>Falta</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">excluded<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-excluded\"> </a></td><td>Excluded</td><td>Excluído</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">returned-to-requester<a name=\"BRStatusRegulacaoAssistencial-returned-to-requester\"> </a></td><td>Returned to requester.</td><td>Devolvido para o solicitante.</td></tr></table></div>"
